1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,780
A person should strive to be better,

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:06,580
not to be the best.

3
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:10,100
Why? Why shouldn't he be the best?

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:14,080
It isn't worth competing over; he looks at those below him

5
00:00:14,120 --> 00:00:16,560
to be content and satisfied.

6
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:21,040
Given these differences, a person should

7
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:25,360
strive to be better,

8
00:00:26,160 --> 00:00:28,240
not to be the best.

9
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,520
Why? Why not be the best?

10
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:35,040
That will ruin your principles;

11
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:38,560
it breeds enmities, burns you out, and makes you belittle His blessings

12
00:00:39,080 --> 00:00:43,200
that Allah has given you, and it defies the laws of the universe.

13
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:46,600
If you strive to be the best, you are competing with

14
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:50,400
the destinies of others — not the others themselves: this is his destiny,

15
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:54,720
this is his provision, and you cannot. Strive to be better,

16
00:00:54,920 --> 00:00:56,780
and work on yourself.
